          <span class="endpoint-summary">Revogar e regenerar API token</span>
          <span class="endpoint-toggle">▼</span>
        </div>
        <div class="endpoint-body">
          <div class="info-box info-box-primary">
            <span class="info-box-icon">🔐</span>
            Requer header <code>Authorization: Bearer &lt;sessionToken&gt;</code>
          </div>
          <p class="endpoint-desc">Não há body. Revoga o API token atual e emite um novo.</p>
          <div class="code-block">
            <div class="code-block-header"><span>Resposta 200</span></div>
            <pre>{
  <span class="code-key">"success"</span>: <span class="code-bool">true</span>,
  <span class="code-key">"message"</span>: <span class="code-string">"API token regenerado com sucesso."</span>,
  <span class="code-key">"data"</span>: {
    <span class="code-key">"apiToken"</span>: <span class="code-string">"stv_xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx"</span>
  }
}</pre>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

